  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of 12th-13th-Century Shajar al-Durr Monument Zone in Historic Cairo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fatimid and early Abbasid period mausoleums of Shajar al-Durr, al-Sayyida Ruqayya, and al-Jafari and Atika in Cairo are under threat from rising damp and salt efflorescence which have compromised their structural integrity and surfaces. This project includes masonry conservation and site drainage measures.</narrative>
  </description>
